    Every string the app puts in front of the user.

    Deliberately not here: the packet log and the connect log. Those are diagnostics, the
    equivalent of logcat, and they name protocol fields and error codes that mean nothing
    once translated - a translated log is harder to act on, not easier.

    Entries marked translatable="false" are identifiers or brand names: the model codes the
    gimbal advertises itself as, and the raw field names shown in the device panel.
-->
